    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d549">

                <pb facs="0625" n="513" sameAs="frus:frus1919Russia/pg513"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">861.00/4911: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Reinsch</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date
                            ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-document-content" calendar="gregorian"
                            notAfter="1919-07-25T13:06:00-04:00"
                            notBefore="1919-07-25T10:00:00+04:53"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >undated</hi></date>.<lb/>[Received July 25, 1919, 1:06
                        p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>From [Harris at] Omsk.</p>
                <p>[“]336, July 25, 10 a.m. Referring to Department’s July 15, 5 a.m. [<hi
                        rendition="#italic">July 16, 6 p.m.?</hi>] General Horvath has been
                    definitely retired and Rozanoff sent Vladivostok to replace him. Harris.”</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Reinsch</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
